A semantic mapping that assigns meaning to a Representation (e.g., 0b101 can interpret as 5 in binary or a bit pattern).

A **semantic mapping** that assigns meaning to a ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/representation.td")} (e.g., `0b101` can interpret as `5` in binary or a bit pattern).
